			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"舒瓦瑟爾"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741361301,
					"content": "呼…沒關係、沒關係，噩夢都結束了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361302,
						741361305,
						741361309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "舒瓦瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361302,
					"content": "你對艾德溫復活有什麼感想？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741361303,
					"content": "哎喲，您嚇我一跳！感想？我沒什麼感想，只希望這不負責任的混帳可以付出代價！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "舒瓦瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361304,
					"content": "如果可以的話，我恨不得把他的手腳都綁起來，把眼睛矇起來，免得他再接觸始基礦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "舒瓦瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361305,
					"content": "現在能夠放心了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361306
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741361306,
					"content": "與之前相比，我的確能稍微安心一點了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "舒瓦瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361307,
					"content": "但說實話…把納克和艾德溫關在一起？天哪！我都不知道他們會做什麼事！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "舒瓦瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361308,
					"content": "上次是爆炸，下次是什麼？用楓達淹沒整個楓丹？我真是不敢想…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "舒瓦瑟爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361309,
					"content": "祝你有個好心情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361310
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741361310,
					"content": "也祝您有美好的一天，榮譽高級研究員。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "舒瓦瑟爾"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7413614,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7413611",
							"3"
						],
						"stepId": 7413611,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_FINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"菲希里耶",
					"勒馬克",
					"肖西韋爾",
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741361401,
					"content": "…沒有價值…我的研究沒價值…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲希里耶"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361402,
					"content": "小姐，您不必這麼想，您的發明可是救了我一命啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒馬克"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361403,
					"content": "但…但艾德溫前輩…嗚嗚…艾德溫先生說，說這個東西沒價值！嗚嗚嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲希里耶"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361404,
					"content": "是那個叫艾德溫的人沒眼光，明明是個珍寶！什麼叫沒價值？我都想幫我手下的兄弟每人配一個了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "肖西韋爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361405,
					"content": "艾德溫是壞人，他說的是謊話。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361406
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741361406,
					"content": "艾德溫前輩不是壞人！他…他…反正…他都不記得我的名字！我還給他看過好多次設計圖！嗚嗚嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲希里耶"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361407,
					"content": "菲希里耶小姐，妳明明就是一個很厲害的人呀！為什麼一定要在意艾德溫那傢伙怎麼評價妳呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361408,
					"content": "他覺得差，我覺得好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741361409,
					"content": "真…真的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲希里耶"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361410,
					"content": "真的啊！妳看，我們都這麼覺得。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "肖西韋爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361411,
					"content": "可是…你們又不懂研究——嗚嗚嗚——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲希里耶"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361412,
					"content": "菲希里耶小姐…完全陷入混亂狀態了呢！不然…我們還是讓她一個人靜一靜好了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741361413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741361413,
					"content": "好…我和勒馬克就在旁邊等著，有什麼事情就叫我們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "肖西韋爾"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}